            <p class="- topic/p " xtrc="p:1;9:16" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">To use the calculator app, you need to unlock your phone first.</p>
        </prereq>
        <context class="- topic/section task/context " xtrc="context:1;11:18" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrc="p:2;12:16" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">You can use a calculator app on your smartphone. You will find it useful, when you
                need to quickly calculate some numbers. </p>
        </context>
        <steps class="- topic/ol task/steps " xtrc="steps:1;15:16" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">
            <step class="- topic/li task/step " xtrc="step:1;16:19" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">
                <cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd " xtrc="cmd:1;17:22" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita"> Navigate to the Calculator application icon.</cmd>
            </step>
            <step class="- topic/li task/step " xtrc="step:2;19:19" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">
                <cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd " xtrc="cmd:2;20:22" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">Tap the icon. </cmd>
            </step>
        </steps>
        <result class="- topic/section task/result " id="unique_1_Connect_42_result_hhv_mdd_m4b" xtrc="result:1;23:41" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrc="p:3;24:16" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita"> The application starts. You are now ready to calculate with it.</p>
        </result>
        <example class="- topic/example " xtrc="example:1;26:18" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/i024155/Desktop/DEMO/task_demo.dita">For example, if you have purchased a book for 5$ and you have given 10$, how much
